CSS ANIMATIONS TO DEFINE:

@keyframes float {
  0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0px); }
  50%       { transform: translateY(-8px); }
}

@keyframes pulse-glow {
  0%, 100% { box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(124,58,237,0.3); }
  50%       { box-shadow: 0 0 60px rgba(124,58,237,0.6); }
}

@keyframes gradient-shift {
  0%   { background-position: 0% 50%; }
  50%  { background-position: 100% 50%; }
  100% { background-position: 0% 50%; }
}

@keyframes draw-line {
  from { stroke-dashoffset: 1000; }
  to   { stroke-dashoffset: 0; }
}

@keyframes node-enter {
  from { transform: scale(0.8); opacity: 0; }
  to   { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }
}

@keyframes shimmer {
  0%   { background-position: -200% center; }
  100% { background-position: 200% center; }
}

@keyframes ambient-drift {
  0%, 100% { transform: translate(0, 0) scale(1); }
  33%       { transform: translate(30px, -20px) scale(1.05); }
  66%       { transform: translate(-20px, 10px) scale(0.98); }
}

SCROLL ANIMATIONS (IntersectionObserver):
  All sections: data-animate="fade-up"
    Initial: opacity 0, translateY 32px
    Triggered: opacity 1, translateY 0
    Duration: 0.6s ease, stagger children 0.08s
  
  Cards: data-animate="scale-in"
    Initial: opacity 0, scale 0.94
    Triggered: opacity 1, scale 1
    Duration: 0.5s ease
  
  Roadmap nodes: triggered as each enters viewport
  SVG connectors: stroke-dashoffset animation on trigger

HOVER MICRO-INTERACTIONS:
  All cards:        translateY(-4px) duration 200ms
  All buttons:      translateY(-2px) + shadow increase 200ms
  Nav links:        underline grows left→right 200ms
  Icons in cards:   scale(1.08) 200ms
  Badge pills:      scale(1.04) + slight glow 150ms
  Sidebar nav items: left-slide bg reveal 200ms

